# HMT-2 (real-money checkpoint) — local/disposable native-source-store artefacts
# (market_truth/acquisition/source_store.py's own documented layout). Real, large
# (up to ~1GB), immutable retained vendor bytes + evidence JSON. Never committed —
# local/disposable filesystem storage only, mirrors market_truth/partition.py's own
# research-partition storage discipline. Evidence of what was retained (hashes, byte
# sizes, record counts) is committed separately in tracked JSON under research/hmt2/.
research-source/
